      "mergeID": "5b7f1a060939c11c844e7ad4",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I was wondering if you could have the online friends and offline in the favorite friends groups seprate. Instead of online, offline, online, online, offline. if that makes sense.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Friends List",
