      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Another option would be to be able to toggle offline friends in groups.\n\nOffline friends inside a group are currently shown. That's good to manage who's in a group but it also contradicts the good part of having groups, which to me is to filter friends to a smaller, well... group (like for example friends you hang out with the most), and being able to quickly check who's online in it.\n\nSo my suggestion is that close to the group's name (where you can click it to rename the group), there should be added a checkbox to show/hide the offline members of the group, or, maybe even better, just add an option in the system menu to do it to all groups.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
